<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>Last updated: September 2026</p>

<h3>1. General Information</h3>
<p>This document sets forth the Privacy Policy of BLOGCITO, an independent travel blog operated by Santiago and Lorena. Your privacy is important to us, and this policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website.</p>

<h3>2. Use of Cookies and Third-Party Services</h3>
<p>Our website uses third-party cookies to improve user experience, display relevant ads, and offer booking functionalities. Specifically:</p>
<ul>
<li>We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve relevant ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites. The use of advertising cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) enables Google and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ads Settings</a>.</li>
<li>We use <strong>Stay22</strong> to display interactive accommodation maps and facilitate booking searches within our articles. This service may use its own cookies to process your search and generate booking links with our affiliate partners.</li>
</ul>

<h3>3. Contact Information</h3>
<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, the use of your data, or the ads displayed on the website, you can contact us through our contact section.</p>

<h3>4. Affiliate Link Disclosure</h3>
<p>BLOGCITO participates in various affiliate marketing programs (such as Impact, Booking, GetYourGuide, Airalo, and Stay22, among others), which means we may earn commissions on bookings or purchases made through our links to third-party sites. This does not alter the price you pay, nor does it influence our recommendations or opinions regarding the mentioned destinations and services.</p>
